    <string name="chatrix_about_fork">Chatrix.One is a fork of Conversations, the XMPP app made by Daniel Gultsch (https://conversations.im).\n\nChatrix.One adds its own look and quick message gestures. Please report problems with this app to Chatrix.One (https://chatrix.one), not to the Conversations developers.\n\nLike Conversations, Chatrix.One is free software under the GNU General Public License v3.\n\n————————————————\n\n</string>
    <string name="chatrix_pref_connection_notification">Connection status notification</string>
    <string name="chatrix_pref_connection_notification_summary">Chatrix.One keeps its own connection open, so Android shows a permanent notification. You can safely turn it off here: messages keep arriving and you still get a warning if the connection fails.</string>
    <string name="chatrix_crash_send_email">Send by email</string>
    <string name="chatrix_pref_update_check">Check for updates</string>
    <string name="chatrix_pref_update_check_summary">Once a day, look at chatrix.eu for a newer Chatrix.One version and show a notification. Nothing is downloaded or installed and no personal data is sent. Not used when installed from F-Droid or another app store, or when Tor is on.</string>
    <string name="chatrix_update_channel">App updates</string>
